OL,3,ASetback for SpaceX Starship rocket's
OL,4,Adouble-catch test
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the aerospace firm's first
OL,7,Fattempt to fully recover its rocket,
OL,8,Fpaving the way for making Starship
OL,9,Ffully reusable so it can fly repeatedly
OL,10,Fand reduce costs.
